    "The %lld decks using it will use the Default preset instead. Takes effect when you save." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the confirmation before deleting a preset several decks use. The placeholder is how many.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このプリセットを使う%lld個のデッキは、保存時に既定のプリセットに切り替わります。"
