            "value" : "使用此预设的 %lld 个牌组会改用默认预设。保存后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deck has its own limits, set in Anki on another device. They apply instead of these and are kept." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the daily limits when the deck has deck-only or today-only limits, which this screen does not edit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
