            "value" : "仅此牌组使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a forgotten review card comes back. Leave empty to skip relearning." : {
      "comment" : "Footer explaining relearning steps.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "忘れた復習カードが再び表示されるまでの間隔です。再学習を省略するには空欄にします。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遗忘的复习卡片再次出现前的等待时间。留空可跳过重新学习。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a new card comes back while you learn it, such as 1m 10m 1d." : {
      "comment" : "Footer explaining learning steps; 1m, 10m and 1d mean one minute, ten minutes and one day.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学習中の新規カードが再び表示されるまでの間隔です（例：1m 10m 1d）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学习新卡片时，卡片再次出现前的等待时间，例如 1m 10m 1d。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you study a card, other cards of the same note wait until the next day." : {
      "comment" : "Footer explaining burying.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードを学習すると、同じノートから作られた他のカードは翌日まで延期されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学习一张卡片后，同一笔记生成的其他卡片会搁置到次日。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is not a step. Enter delays such as 1m 10m 1d, using s, m, h or d." : {
      "comment" : "Shown under a learning or relearning steps field when part of what was typed is not a delay. The placeholder is the part that is wrong.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」は有効なステップではありません。s、m、h、dを使い、1m 10m 1dのように間隔を入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”不是有效的步骤。请使用 s、m、h 或 d 输入等待时间，例如 1m 10m 1d。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A delay of zero disables the timed action for that side." : {
